{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>If it is in your soul to bury.</b> If you wish to bury the dead promptly, as you indicated by saying <b>bury in the choicest of our sepulchres</b>, so that I need not delay." "<b>Hear me.</b> Agree that there shall be to me <b>a burial-possession</b>." "<b>And intercede for me with Ephron.</b> That he sell, even though it is unseemly for an honorable man to sell from his possession, as Naboth testified, as it says (I Kings 21:3): חָלִילָה לִי מִתִּתִּי אֶת נַחֲלַת אֲבוֹתַי לָךְ."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:13.146946058Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}